{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/8151aea2a133aa130613d4c40d180895.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/8151aea2a133aa130613d4c40d180895.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/8151aea2a133aa130613d4c40d180895.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/97b2e5d878c869a1de7239a4af3874d6.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A mesmerizing, intertwined, decaying world awaits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are MIO, a nimble robot with extraordinary abilities. You wake up in the Vessel, a space ship drifting aimlessly in space.This enormous technological ark, whose initial purpose remains unknown, lies now as a field of ruins, overgrown with lush vegetation and machines gone rogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nobody knows why the Pearls, The Vessel's AI caretakers, have ceased functioning. Forgotten by all, the Vessel faces imminent shutdown. Dive into its depths to revive its lost memories, as you unravel your true past and destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/cf29cd56cde7e19e5daca412d37b63df.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/50e7af005be944d02d8029542afd8ce3.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/50e7af005be944d02d8029542afd8ce3.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/50e7af005be944d02d8029542afd8ce3.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Delve into this mesmerizing metroidvania, as you guide MIO through the vast expanse of the Vessel. You won\u2019t be alone on your journey. Repair damaged robots and help them to unveil the Ark's past and gain valuable bonuses. Interact with the environment to learn more about its past and memories. Unravel the dark secrets behind its tragic blackout. And let your curiosity guide you as you discover its many secret pathways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/71d00ba0fd92bee612e91b2f01644fa7.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/38bc9b76dd25b47c822a7053af6d0469.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/38bc9b76dd25b47c822a7053af6d0469.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/38bc9b76dd25b47c822a7053af6d0469.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience a magnificent world of breathtaking scenery and innumerable details. Inspired by comics, paintings, and anime, its universe is full of wonder and artistic curiosities. Let its unique and dynamic soundtrack, blending lo-fi beats and choral melodies, carry you through this captivating universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/7f37c3ee2198b4a5398250ea1d6f17f6.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/e9537e14a74cf182d6359d2816f42ce7.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/e9537e14a74cf182d6359d2816f42ce7.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/e9537e14a74cf182d6359d2816f42ce7.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a gigantic labyrinth, the Vessel is a true living organism, with its own ecosystems, bestiaries and architectures. Earn game-changer abilities, like grappling hook, air gliding or spider-like wall clinging, to help MIO progress through this twisted and interconnected space. Master precision, rhythm, and timing to find the perfect flow! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/dddd8617147fc59bbde7da1f384e34b9.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/b68640531aa694221b9a03392a7f85f2.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/b68640531aa694221b9a03392a7f85f2.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/b68640531aa694221b9a03392a7f85f2.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face off a diverse array of over 30 enemy units and 15 formidable guardian bosses. From the relentless Mosquito to the menacing Scarecrow, confront a variety of deadly adversaries each with their own distinct fighting styles and movement patterns. Use your arsenal of powers to adapt to every encounter. Evade foes using your Hook, unleash orbs as powerful projectiles, and even create decoy clones to strike from unexpected angles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/e86aa8e9c984efed7283a34a31109e25.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/5f69a1fbc5556777defd93bb238428b6.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/5f69a1fbc5556777defd93bb238428b6.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/5f69a1fbc5556777defd93bb238428b6.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enhance and customize MIO abilities by scavenging enemy components. Spice up your fighting skills with many Modifiers and transform MIO into a formidable force tailored to your playstyle. Would you make your grappling Hook a deadly lasso or an evade move? Sacrifice your Shield to boost your damage? It\u2019s always your choice! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you rise to the challenge and save the Vessel from oblivion? Will you dare to seek and wake its memories?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Memories in Orbit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1672810/87290eaf48305d89ea5a088a35432eba88092368.jpg"},{"name":"Fully modded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1672810/fdc5b56e6fbb0c1e0a5d0fdc45670c35a91ab736.jpg"},{"name":"Fully shielded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1672810/567dfa546260a45e71e631d7868d8364d9273e9f.jpg"},{"name":"Tribute","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1672810/0815ab6bacc95df75513c60692a23c3e2e9f02dd.jpg"},{"name":"Wait...what?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1672810/b825e3f167ebacdd824a2544bc8a4ee93b42dde9.jpg"},{"name":"Light source","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1672810/e55f7b110dedfe15b62fea5f951117807c8461f4.jpg"},{"name":"Not welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1672810/6b635343c70da3286937d2b428443ed43aa72a3c.jpg"},{"name":"Now we can go on","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1672810/f9853bd626931876372ccf0df1c5554982629f1b.jpg"},{"name":"Out of stock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1672810/f31edf72e9c77e7c297763f5f6e00e12aa42a806.jpg"},{"name":"Fully upgraded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1672810/fc3b49890258b367c6ce00abc975c75f0ba9aaf6.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1672810?t=1770197936","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770197936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/661b8a5b74d8a4c1036252d5195c69833307a7e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770197936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/661b8a5b74d8a4c1036252d5195c69833307a7e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770197936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/8151aea2a133aa130613d4c40d180895.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/8151aea2a133aa130613d4c40d180895.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/8151aea2a133aa130613d4c40d180895.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/97b2e5d878c869a1de7239a4af3874d6.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A mesmerizing, intertwined, decaying world awaits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are MIO, a nimble robot with extraordinary abilities. You wake up in the Vessel, a space ship drifting aimlessly in space.This enormous technological ark, whose initial purpose remains unknown, lies now as a field of ruins, overgrown with lush vegetation and machines gone rogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nobody knows why the Pearls, The Vessel's AI caretakers, have ceased functioning. Forgotten by all, the Vessel faces imminent shutdown. Dive into its depths to revive its lost memories, as you unravel your true past and destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/cf29cd56cde7e19e5daca412d37b63df.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/50e7af005be944d02d8029542afd8ce3.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/50e7af005be944d02d8029542afd8ce3.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/50e7af005be944d02d8029542afd8ce3.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Delve into this mesmerizing metroidvania, as you guide MIO through the vast expanse of the Vessel. You won\u2019t be alone on your journey. Repair damaged robots and help them to unveil the Ark's past and gain valuable bonuses. Interact with the environment to learn more about its past and memories. Unravel the dark secrets behind its tragic blackout. And let your curiosity guide you as you discover its many secret pathways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/71d00ba0fd92bee612e91b2f01644fa7.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/38bc9b76dd25b47c822a7053af6d0469.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/38bc9b76dd25b47c822a7053af6d0469.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/38bc9b76dd25b47c822a7053af6d0469.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience a magnificent world of breathtaking scenery and innumerable details. Inspired by comics, paintings, and anime, its universe is full of wonder and artistic curiosities. Let its unique and dynamic soundtrack, blending lo-fi beats and choral melodies, carry you through this captivating universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/7f37c3ee2198b4a5398250ea1d6f17f6.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/e9537e14a74cf182d6359d2816f42ce7.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/e9537e14a74cf182d6359d2816f42ce7.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/e9537e14a74cf182d6359d2816f42ce7.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a gigantic labyrinth, the Vessel is a true living organism, with its own ecosystems, bestiaries and architectures. Earn game-changer abilities, like grappling hook, air gliding or spider-like wall clinging, to help MIO progress through this twisted and interconnected space. Master precision, rhythm, and timing to find the perfect flow! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/dddd8617147fc59bbde7da1f384e34b9.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/b68640531aa694221b9a03392a7f85f2.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/b68640531aa694221b9a03392a7f85f2.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/b68640531aa694221b9a03392a7f85f2.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face off a diverse array of over 30 enemy units and 15 formidable guardian bosses. From the relentless Mosquito to the menacing Scarecrow, confront a variety of deadly adversaries each with their own distinct fighting styles and movement patterns. Use your arsenal of powers to adapt to every encounter. Evade foes using your Hook, unleash orbs as powerful projectiles, and even create decoy clones to strike from unexpected angles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/e86aa8e9c984efed7283a34a31109e25.avif?t=1770197936\" width=1560 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/5f69a1fbc5556777defd93bb238428b6.poster.avif?t=1770197936\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/5f69a1fbc5556777defd93bb238428b6.webm?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1672810/extras/5f69a1fbc5556777defd93bb238428b6.mp4?t=1770197936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enhance and customize MIO abilities by scavenging enemy components. Spice up your fighting skills with many Modifiers and transform MIO into a formidable force tailored to your playstyle. Would you make your grappling Hook a deadly lasso or an evade move? Sacrifice your Shield to boost your damage? It\u2019s always your choice! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you rise to the challenge and save the Vessel from oblivion? Will you dare to seek and wake its memories?</strong></p>","developers":["Douze Dixi\u00e8mes"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st